123045,"title":"","content":"This is exactly what I did some years ago: both the ganconer and the bean-sidhe were Thallain, cousins to the sidhe, the result of the experiments the White Fomorians made on the first tribe of the daoine sidhe (as told in Dreams &amp; Nightmares), and the spark that lit the War of Trees.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3747-mattboggan","name":"mattboggan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3747_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-01T16:07:38-07:00","id":1123676,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mattboggan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1122133-gancanagh-kith?p=1123045#post1123045\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is exactly what I did some years ago: both the ganconer and the bean-sidhe were Thallain, cousins to the sidhe, the result of the experiments the White Fomorians made on the first tribe of the daoine sidhe (as told in Dreams &amp; Nightmares), and the spark that lit the War of Trees.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Do you have the write-up of the bean-sidhe? I'd be interested in how you made that into Thallain.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://imgbb.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://image.ibb.c